{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スーパーボウル、凄い試合でしたね！！\nと、言いたいところなんですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日に限って朝から晩まで仕事詰めで\nまだ見れる環境にないのです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"試合結果も我慢していて\nまだ何も知らない状態なので、\n(今凄いもどかしい気分...)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このブログを送った後にハーフタイムショー含め\n録画した試合を全部見たいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのでスーパーボウルに関してのブログは\n明日にします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しタイムラグがあるけど\n気にしないでねヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/06/9153238/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/06/9153238/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く見たいよ〜\n語りたいよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば昨日の個別握手会、\nみなみと髪型がお揃いだった〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/06/9153238/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お団子♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなみなみは今日がお誕生日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみお誕生日おめでとう〜( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"JC8です♡\nとかやっていた私たちなのに\nもうみなみが19歳になるなんて...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時が経つのは早すぎて驚きですが\nみなみは昔から変わらず可愛いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも可愛いみなみでいてね☺︎\nってメールもしました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/02/06/9153238/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初自撮りでお団子写そうと思ったんだけど\n意外と上から撮らないと写らなくて\n断念したときの写真。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人とも鳥みたいになってる...(*´-`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「SNOW SOUND」【Alexandros】さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Alexandrosさんの新曲、\nこの季節には聞きたくなるような\n爽やかで美しい雪の歌！\n雪国に憧れる...\n\"白い街の片隅で僕等出逢う\nまだまだあどけない雪がやわらかく包んでいく\"\nなんて素敵な歌詞！\n白い街の片隅でってきゅんとくる。\nいいな〜雪。\nあどけない雪っていうのもまたいい。\nやっぱりAlexandrosさん好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もChihAnswer募集します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってます〜◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、スーパーボウルみてきます☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}